name: ['Academy Ruins', 'Arcane Signet', 'Blasphemous Act', 'Bloodsworn Steward', 'Boompile', 'Buried Ruin', 'Cascade Bluffs', 'Chance Encounter', "Chandra's Ignition", 'Chaos Warp', 'Command Tower', "Commander's Plate", 'Counterspell', 'Crooked Scales', 'Daretti, Scrap Savant', 'Desolate Lighthouse', 'Embercleave', 'Exotic Orchard', 'Fabricate', 'Fiery Gambit', 'Flamekin Village', 'Footfall Crater', 'Frenetic Sliver', 'Gamble', 'Goblin Archaeologist', 'Goblin Engineer', 'Goblin Kaboomist', 'Great Furnace', 'Impulsive Maneuvers', "Inventors' Fair", 'Island', 'Izzet Boilerworks', 'Izzet Signet', 'Karplusan Minotaur', 'Krark, the Thumbless', 'Lightning Greaves', 'Long-Term Plans', 'Mind Stone', 'Mirror March', 'Mogg Assassin', 'Mountain', 'Muddle the Mixture', 'Myriad Landscape', 'Negate', 'Niv-Mizzet, Parun', 'Path of Ancestry', 'Planar Chaos', 'Ponder', 'Preordain', 'Ral Zarek', 'Reliquary Tower', 'Reshape', 'Risky Move', "Rogue's Passage", 'Sakashima the Impostor', 'Seize the Day', 'Serum Visions', 'Shadowspear', 'Shivan Reef', 'Slip Through Space', 'Sol Ring', 'Spark Double', 'Spinerock Knoll', "Squee's Revenge", 'Sulfur Falls', 'Swiftfoot Boots', 'Sword of Vengeance', 'Talisman of Creativity', 'Tavern Scoundrel', 'Temple of Epiphany', 'Temple of the False God', 'Temur Battle Rage', 'The Locust God', 'Thought Vessel', 'Tolaria West', 'Training Center', 'Tribute Mage', 'Vandalblast', 'Wandering Fumarole', 'Whir of Invention', 'Whispersilk Cloak', "Yusri, Fortune's Flame"]
